{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Enigma</i> is a solo puzzle game where the player takes control of two interdependent cubes. Each must be used strategically to progress and solve ingenious puzzles. The adventure unfolds in a semi-open world, blending exploration with linear progression, where every challenge demands deep thinking and precise coordination between the two cubes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game will take you through a variety of biomes, each introducing unique mechanics and brand-new challenges. You'll have to face blinding snowstorms, slippery ice surfaces that limit your control, and many other obstacles that will put your problem-solving and adaptability to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to master these hostile environments and overcome every puzzle to uncover all the secrets of <i>Enigma</i>?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3536770?t=1741058694","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536770/72ad1398f1f708e1f89d0a208569aa140bb40810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741058694","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536770/2118d01780d77dccd9f343bfe1184c8203feaa29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741058694","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536770/2118d01780d77dccd9f343bfe1184c8203feaa29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741058694","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Enigma</i> is a solo puzzle game where the player takes control of two interdependent cubes. Each must be used strategically to progress and solve ingenious puzzles. The adventure unfolds in a semi-open world, blending exploration with linear progression, where every challenge demands deep thinking and precise coordination between the two cubes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game will take you through a variety of biomes, each introducing unique mechanics and brand-new challenges. You'll have to face blinding snowstorms, slippery ice surfaces that limit your control, and many other obstacles that will put your problem-solving and adaptability to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to master these hostile environments and overcome every puzzle to uncover all the secrets of <i>Enigma</i>?</p>","developers":["Cosmos23"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536770/14ab5111c4273698275bb79512981ab67c560afa/header.jpg?t=1741058694","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257107364,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107364/movie480.mp4?t=1740790059","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107364/movie_max.mp4?t=1740790059"},"name":"Engima - 2024 Reveal Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257107364/4244194c50fa125ef4bf7db332bb0d43397bfa81/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740790059","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107364/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740790059","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107364/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740790059"}}],"name":"Egnima","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Window 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Carte int\u00e9gr\u00e9e Intel UHD ou Radeon Vega<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 116 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"lin